1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 16=

3
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:17,200
(In Memoriam)

4
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:29,840
(In Memoriam)

5
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,440
Was it Zhang Jinghang's mother's funeral

6
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:41,560
that Li Junsheng crashed?

7
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:55,080
(In Memoriam)

8
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,520
You got me locked up,

9
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,200
and now you're living
the good life, huh?

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,200
Pretty comfortable now, aren't you?

11
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,920
Well, I'm out early.

12
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,320
And I'm gonna make your life hell.

13
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:11,840
Xiyu.

14
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:13,320
Who the hell are you?

15
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,200
What's wrong with you?

16
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:15,920
(In Memoriam)

17
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,040
You're here for me.

18
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,920
Whatever it is, let's talk outside.

19
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,520
Who do you think you are?

20
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,480
Why should I do what you say?

21
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:35,520
Stop!

22
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:36,520
Stop fighting!

23
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,400
Don't stoop to that lunatic's level.

24
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,080
He trashed my mother's memorial!

25
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:41,960
Security!

26
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,120
Call security!

27
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,640
I'll make sure you regret it.

28
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,400
I'm not letting any of you off!

29
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,200
He came for me.

30
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,520
I never thought he'd wreck
your mother's memorial

31
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,400
like this.

32
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,000
I'll cover all the costs.

33
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,760
We are really sorry.

34
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,440
Because of us,

35
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,000
your mother couldn't even rest in peace.

36
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,520
Both of you, leave.

37
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:16,840
Go!

38
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,680
Go!

39
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,160
Let's go now.

40
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,040
Come on.

41
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,160
Maybe...

42
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:43,960
this is just my fate.

43
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:48,680
You can't say that.

44
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,640
(Why did I foresee Li Junsheng
going to the memorial?)

45
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,000
(What is this trying to tell me?)

46
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,840
What's wrong?

47
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,400
I think I just saw...

48
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:15,240
Hold on.

49
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,080
(Assistant)

50
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:17,960
Mr. He,

51
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,920
Mr. Chen needs you at the office
right away.

52
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:20,960
What happened?

53
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:23,080
Some loan sharks
are blocking the entrance.

54
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,720
They said if you don't pay up,

55
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,880
they're not going anywhere.

56
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:26,640
You called the police, right?

57
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,440
They haven't actually
caused any trouble,

58
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,960
so calling the police
won't actually help.

59
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,400
All right. Got it.

60
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,360
I'll be right there.

61
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,080
What were you saying?

62
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,320
Why would loan sharks go to Yunshan?

63
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,840
After Li Junsheng got out,

64
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,880
he got addicted to gambling

65
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,280
and racked up a ton of debt.

66
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,080
So now they're coming after me
for money.

67
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:54,440
(30 Years of Baili Improving
Workplaces and Quality of Life)

68
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,640
We've already lost so many clients
this morning.

69
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,000
Sir,

70
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,760
you worked hard to get where you are.

71
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,520
Don't let a few loan sharks ruin it.

72
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:10,760
Don't worry.

73
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,720
They won't do anything to me here.

74
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,280
Which one of you is looking for me?

75
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,160
You're Li Junsheng's little brother,

76
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,080
He Lan?

77
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,240
That's right.

78
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,600
I'm He Lan.

79
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,560
Debts have to be paid.
You get that, right?

80
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:46,000
Guess he didn't tell you

81
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,400
I'm the one who turned him in.

82
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,840
We're not related by blood.

83
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,800
And we're certainly not brothers.

84
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,280
Do whatever you want with him.

85
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,280
And another thing.

86
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,040
I'm just an employee at Yunshan.

87
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:04,760
If you're trying to cost me my job,

88
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,000
I'll just find another one.

89
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:07,560
I don't care.

90
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:19,040
Chief,

91
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,560
so we're just writing off
what Li Junsheng owes us?

92
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,120
Not a chance.

93
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,720
Look into He Lan's connections.

94
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,840
We're just getting started.

95
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:28,760
Got it.

96
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:35,880
Do you know who I am?

97
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,000
Whatever Li Junsheng owes you

98
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,400
has nothing to do with He Lan or me.

99
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,960
Li Junsheng may be hiding,

100
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,920
but his debt doesn't just disappear.

101
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:45,880
Wait.

102
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,440
If He Lan doesn't pay up,

103
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,080
I'll keep coming after you

104
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:52,960
until he does.

105
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,520
(First they harass him at Yunshan,)

106
00:05:54,520 --> 00:05:55,640
(now they're cornering me
at the dance company.)

107
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,000
(Sounds like they plan to use me)

108
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,560
(to pressure He Lan into paying.)

109
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,720
(If this goes on,
the problem will only stay unsolved.)

110
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,600
(Maybe...)

111
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,080
How much does Li Junsheng owe you?

112
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,160
Not much.

113
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,440
Principal plus interest,

114
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,280
three hundred thousand.

115
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,760
I'll give you five hundred thousand.

116
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,040
Bring Li Junsheng to me.

117
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,960
He Lan and I are going to
start a family.

118
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,680
With Li Junsheng's gambling addict,

119
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,960
his debt will only
grow heavier and heavier.

120
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,800
He owes three hundred thousand now,

121
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,160
and it could grow into
a million in no time.

122
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,680
Works for me.

123
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,440
Yeah?

124
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:29,920
Deal.

125
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,480
Three days from now,

126
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:32,640
you bring the money,

127
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,920
and I'll bring him to you.

128
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,800
It's a deal.

129
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:35,880
Deal.

130
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,320
(I need to call the police first.)

131
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,600
(Then I can take all of them down
at once.)

132
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:52,160
(Three Days Later)

133
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,880
I brought the money.

134
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,800
Hand over Li Junsheng.

135
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,440
Girl,

136
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,120
you don't exactly look tough.

137
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,520
What are you planning

138
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,000
to do with Li Junsheng?

139
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,880
Teach him a lesson, obviously.

140
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:23,280
Are you going to break an arm of his?

141
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,040
Or maybe a leg?

142
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:26,080
Come on.

143
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,080
Do it.

144
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,120
We're all

145
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,680
dying to see it.

146
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:33,880
Go on.

147
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:37,440
I...

148
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,280
You don't have the guts, do you?

149
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:46,440
You're stalling for the cops,
aren't you?

150
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,640
Trying to play me with the cops?

151
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:00,960
You're way too green!

152
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,240
You got a death wish, huh?

153
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,840
I'll make that happen.

154
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,560
(Am I going to die again?)

155
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:13,040
(But today isn't April 4, 2025.)

156
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,760
(If fate has already changed,)

157
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,360
(does that mean if I die now,)

158
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,480
(the loop will never start again?)

159
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:19,480
Xiyu!

160
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,360
Xiyu,

161
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:38,400
are you okay?

162
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,040
I'm fine.

163
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,040
Watch out!

164
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:54,680
He Lan?

165
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,120
He Lan!

166
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:10,600
(Xiaoba)

167
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:14,920
Xiaoba,

168
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,520
did Xiyu come to the cafe
looking for you?

169
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,640
It's my day off. I wasn't at work.

170
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,440
I couldn't reach her just now,

171
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,640
so I called her mom.

172
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,560
She said Xiyu hasn't come home yet.

173
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:24,560
Okay.

174
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,200
Got it.

175
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:39,720
(Emergency Resuscitation Room)

176
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:55,080
(Emergency Resuscitation Room)

177
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,520
The patient's hemorrhaging.
We can't stop the bleeding.

178
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,120
We're running low on blood.

179
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,000
Call for more.

180
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,480
Also,

181
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:22,480
his brain activity is abnormal.

182
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,240
Get Director Huang in here.

183
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:23,560
Now!

184
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:23,880
Okay.

185
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,560
Doctor!

186
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,160
You can save him, right?

187
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:27,920
We'll do everything we can.

188
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,800
But he's in very serious condition.

189
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,080
You need to prepare yourself.

190
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,080
Please contact his legal next of kin

191
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,440
to sign the critical condition notice.

192
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:40,520
(We promised we'd change
history together.)

193
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:43,200
(After everything we've done,)

194
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,680
(is this how it ends,
with him leaving first?)

195
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,560
(We'll do everything we can.)

196
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:54,440
(But he's in very serious condition.)

197
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,600
(You need to prepare yourself.)

198
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:59,480
(Am I destined to die no matter what?)

199
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,720
(He Lan was supposed to live.)

200
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:06,360
(But twice now, he's lost his life
because of me.)

201
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,280
(If he dies,)

202
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,600
(what would I have left to live for?)

203
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,400
(If I just take this one step,)

204
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,760
(everything can start over again.)

205
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:36,280
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

206
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:42,840
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

207
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:46,960
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

208
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:50,120
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

209
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:53,040
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

210
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:56,520
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

211
00:11:57,680 --> 00:12:02,760
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

212
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:09,320
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

213
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,600
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

214
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:16,480
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

215
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:19,320
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

216
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:23,440
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

217
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:26,320
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

218
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:29,720
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

219
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:32,120
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

220
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:36,120
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

221
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:40,200
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

222
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:43,240
♪I could give you another future♪

223
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:49,680
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

224
00:12:49,680 --> 00:12:52,000
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

225
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,640
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

226
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,400
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

227
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,680
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

228
00:12:57,680 --> 00:13:01,680
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

229
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:02,640
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

230
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:09,400
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

231
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:15,840
♪I don't want an eternity without you♪

232
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:18,600
♪Even if holding on is more dangerous♪

233
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:20,280
♪More dangerous than letting go♪

234
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:23,480
♪At least we were real in this moment♪

235
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:27,160
♪At least none of this was pretend♪

236
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:29,280
♪In every life where I have you♪

237
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:35,000
♪I choose you in every lifetime
and every day♪

238
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,920
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

239
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:38,960
♪Is nothing but a poor attempt
to fool myself♪

240
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:41,000
♪If I could really stay away♪

241
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,840
♪Then this wouldn't be longing♪

242
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:45,040
♪If every time I wake up♪

243
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:47,421
♪I still end up falling for you♪

